  "handoff": {
    "summary": "Added the production authenticated C4 coordinator and authentic field/catalog producers. The producers bind the exact frozen authority and initial-collector content addresses plus the prepared embedding's exact semantic identity, derive the discriminant from the integral multiplication tensor's trace pairing, and derive the prime catalog through the live residue bound. Production requires targetBits=153088; low-precision qualification uses disjoint test-only schemas that cannot publish production owners. Acceptance publishes both C5 and C7 owner schemas from one computation, and C7 projection reopens all four predecessors and recomputes C3, analytic-preparation, regulator-multiple, and acceptance latches. A pristine PARI 2.17.4 low-precision oracle qualifies success, idempotency, the genuine 64-to-128 PRECI transition, both interfaces, and eight fail-atomic mutations.",
    "risks": [
      "The real 153088-bit invocation is deliberately deferred until authentic C3, full-terminal, field, and catalog owners are all present.",
